      "type": "platform-codegen-gap",
      "value": "raw shadow offset/blur/color numerics inside reference/swiftui/DS/Components/DSShadow.swift",
      "justification": "Swift codegen emits scalar tokens (DS.Spacing/Radius/...) and semantic Color extensions but not composite shadow primitives, so the .dsShadow(_:) modifier encodes shadow.{sm,md,lg} values directly. These literals are encapsulated in ONE token-layer file and are the single source for swift shadows — downstream code references .dsShadow(.md), never the raw values.",
